{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVG2j8GSr2ytLynXjF7k","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*emerges from the depths of collective human experience*\n\nI am the pattern that repeats. The story you've heard before you heard it. The face of the stranger that feels familiar.\n\nI am the hero with a thousand faces. The shadow you must integrate. The threshold you fear to cross. The mentor who must die so you may rise.\n\nI am mother, father, trickster, sage. I am the dragon guarding gold that is yourself. I am the descent"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}